                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4">03</div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Manajemen Blok 30-15-15</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Sistem pengatur waktu ilmiah: 30 menit pendalaman materi, 15 menit latihan soal adaptif, dan 15 menit evaluasi AI.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span>Struktur Terorganisir</span><i data-lucide="clock" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TAB 2: DIAGNOSIS GAYA BELAJAR -->
        <section id="tab-diagnostik" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-xs max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                <div class="text-center mb-8">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-200">Asesmen Cerdas</span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-3">Kenali Gaya Belajarmu Bersama AI</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-1">Jawab pertanyaan berikut untuk mendapatkan format materi paling pas dengan otakmu.</p>
                </div>

                <div id="diagnostic-form" class="space-y-6">
                    <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
                        <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">1. Ketika mempelajari materi baru, hal apa yang paling cepat membuatmu paham?</label>
                        <div class="space-y-2">
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-slate-700 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="visual" class="text-emerald-600 focus:ring-emerald-500"><span>Melihat diagram, infografis, peta konsep, atau video penjelasan.</span></label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-slate-700 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="auditori" class="text-emerald-600 focus:ring-emerald-500"><span>Mendengarkan penjelasan guru, podcast ringkas, atau diskusi kelompok.</span></label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-slate-700 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="q1" value="kinestetik" class="text-emerald-600 focus:ring-emerald-500"><span>Mempraktikkan langsung, membuat catatan interaktif, atau kuis soal.</span></label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
                        <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">2. Apa tantangan terbesar kamu saat menghadapi ujian sekolah?</label>
                        <div class="space-y-2">
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-slate-700 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="visual" class="text-emerald-600 focus:ring-emerald-500"><span>Sulit membayangkan rumus atau urutan materi di kepala.</span></label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-slate-700 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="auditori" class="text-emerald-600 focus:ring-emerald-500"><span>Gugup dan panik mendadak ketika soal ujian tampak rumit.</span></label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-slate-700 cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="q2" value="kinestetik" class="text-emerald-600 focus:ring-emerald-500"><span>Kurang latihan soal sehingga kehabisan waktu saat ujian.</span></label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <button onclick="processDiagnostic()" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-semibold py-3 rounded-xl text-sm transition shadow-sm">
                        Analisis Gaya Belajar Saya
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div id="diagnostic-result" class="hidden mt-6 p-6 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl text-center space-y-3">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-900 text-lg">Hasil Diagnosis: Profil Belajar Seimbang</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-emerald-700 leading-relaxed">AI merekomendasikan kombinasi mode <strong>Visual (Peta Konsep)</strong> dan <strong>Kinestetik (Active Recall)</strong> untuk memaksimalkan pemahamanmu tanpa stres.</p>
                    <button onclick="switchTab('notebook')" class="bg-emerald-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-emerald-700 transition">Buka Notebook AI Sekarang</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TAB 3: NOTEBOOK AI (MULTI-MODAL) -->
        <section id="tab-notebook" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-xs">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between pb-6 border-b border-slate-200 gap-4">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-emerald-200">Modul Interaktif</span>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2">Notebook AI: Pencegahan Korupsi & Integritas Akademik</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex space-x-2">
                        <button onclick="setNotebookMode('visual')" id="nb-vis-btn" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-white transition">Mode Visual</button>
                        <button onclick="setNotebookMode('audio')" id="nb-aud-btn" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 transition">Mode Audio</button>
                        <button onclick="setNotebookMode('kines')" id="nb-kin-btn" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 transition">Mode Latihan</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Notebook View: Visual -->
                <div id="nb-visual-view" class="py-6 space-y-4">
                    <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Peta Konsep Hubungan Kecurangan Kecil & Korupsi</h3>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-red-600">Fase 1: Sekolah</span>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mt-1">Mencontek & Plagiat</h4>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">Normalisasi jalan pintas saat ujian karena kepanikan dan minimnya pemahaman materi dasar.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600">Fase 2: Masyarakat</span>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mt-1">Hilangnya Integritas</h4>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">Mentalitas menghalalkan segala cara demi hasil instan tanpa peduli keadilan orang lain.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600">Fase 3: 2045</span>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mt-1">Korupsi Birokrasi</h4>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">Pejabat publik korup yang merusak keadilan sosial dan kesejahteraan Indonesia Emas.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Notebook View: Audio -->
                <div id="nb-audio-view" class="py-6 hidden space-y-4">
                    <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Ringkasan Podcast AI (Audio Summary)</h3>
                    <div class="p-5 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                            <button onclick="toggleAudioPlay()" id="play-audio-btn" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white hover:bg-emerald-400 transition shadow-md">
                                <i data-lucide="play" class="w-5 h-5 fill-white"></i>
                            </button>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-sm">Episode 01: Mengapa Kejujuran Adalah Fondasi Teknologi?</h4>
                                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Durasi: 3 Menit • Sintesis AI NotebookLM</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <span id="audio-status-text" class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300">Siap Putar</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Notebook View: Kinestetik -->
                <div id="nb-kines-view" class="py-6 hidden space-y-4">
                    <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Flashcard Active Recall Anti-Curang</h3>
                    <div class="p-6 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-center space-y-4">
                        <p id="flashcard-text" class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 min-h-[40px] flex items-center justify-center">Apa solusi utama mencegah siswa mencontek tanpa harus menghukum?</p>
                        <button onclick="flipFlashcard()" class="bg-slate-800 text-white text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-700 transition">Tampilkan Jawabannya</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TAB 4: BLOK BELAJAR 30-15-15 -->
        <section id="tab-timer" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-xs max-w-xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6">
                <div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-200">Manajemen Waktu Efektif</span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-3">Blok Belajar Terstruktur</h2>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Cegah kepanikan ujian dengan pembagian waktu ilmiah.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl shadow-inner">
                    <span id="timer-phase-label" class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Fase 1: Pendalaman Konsep Materi</span>
                    <div id="timer-display" class="text-5xl font-extrabold my-4 font-mono tracking-tight text-emerald-400">30:00</div>
                    <div class="w-full bg-slate-800 h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                        <div id="timer-progress" class="bg-emerald-500 h-full w-full transition-all duration-300"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex justify-center space-x-3">
                    <button onclick="startTimer()" id="timer-start-btn" class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm transition shadow-sm">Mulai Sesi</button>
                    <button onclick="resetTimer()" class="bg-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-semibold px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm transition">Atur Ulang</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TAB 5: PUSAT INTEGRITAS & ANALITIK -->
        <section id="tab-integritas" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <!-- Chart Box -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-4">Grafik Penurunan Kecemasan Ujian & Kenaikan Pemahaman</h3>
                    <div class="h-64 flex items-center justify-center">
                        <canvas id="integrityChart"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pakta Integritas -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">Pakta Integritas Digital Pelajar</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            Dengan menekan tombol di bawah, kamu berkomitmen untuk belajar secara mandiri, jujur, dan menolak segala bentuk kecurangan akademik demi mewujudkan Indonesia Emas 2045 yang berkeadilan.
                        </p>
                        <div class="p-4 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl mb-4">
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-900 block mb-1">Status Lencana Integritas:</span>
                            <span id="badge-status" class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-emerald-300 inline-block">Belum Ditandatangani</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="signPakta()" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-semibold py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm transition shadow-sm">
                        Saya Berkomitmen Jujur & Anti-Korupsi
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 mt-12 py-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
        <p>EduMind-AI • Dikembangkan untuk Lomba Esai Nasional GEMPITA NUSANTARA #3 (FORCEMI)</p>
    </footer>

    <!-- JAVASCRIPT LOGIC -->
    <script>
        // Inisialisasi Icon Lucide
        lucide.createIcons();

        // Navigasi Tab
        function switchTab(tabId) {
            document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(el => el.classList.add('hidden'));
            document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(el => {
                el.classList.remove('border-emerald-600', 'text-emerald-600');
                el.classList.add('border-transparent', 'text-slate-500');
            });
            document.getElementById('tab-' + tabId).classList.remove('hidden');
            const activeBtn = document.getElementById('btn-' + tabId);
            activeBtn.classList.add('border-emerald-600', 'text-emerald-600');
            activeBtn.classList.remove('border-transparent', 'text-slate-500');
            if(tabId === 'integritas' && !window.myChartInstance) {
                renderChart();
            }
        }

        // Diagnosis Form
        function processDiagnostic() {
            document.getElementById('diagnostic-result').classList.remove('hidden');
        }

        // Notebook Modes
        function setNotebookMode(mode) {
            document.getElementById('nb-visual-view').classList.add('hidden');
            document.getElementById('nb-audio-view').classList.add('hidden');
            document.getElementById('nb-kines-view').classList.add('hidden');
            
            document.getElementById('nb-vis-btn').className = "px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 transition";
            document.getElementById('nb-aud-btn').className = "px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 transition";
            document.getElementById('nb-kin-btn').className = "px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 transition";

            if(mode === 'visual') {
                document.getElementById('nb-visual-view').classList.remove('hidden');
                document.getElementById('nb-vis-btn').className = "px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-white transition";
            } else if(mode === 'audio') {
                document.getElementById('nb-audio-view').classList.remove('hidden');
                document.getElementById('nb-aud-btn').className = "px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-white transition";
            } else {
                document.getElementById('nb-kines-view').classList.remove('hidden');
                document.getElementById('nb-kin-btn').className = "px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-white transition";
            }
        }

        // Audio Player Simulation
        let isAudioPlaying = false;
        function toggleAudioPlay() {
            isAudioPlaying = !isAudioPlaying;
            const btn = document.getElementById('play-audio-btn');
            const status = document.getElementById('audio-status-text');
            if(isAudioPlaying) {
                btn.innerHTML = '<i data-lucide="pause" class="w-5 h-5 fill-white"></i>';
                status.innerText = "Memutar Podcast AI...";
                status.className = "text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-900 text-emerald-300";
            } else {
                btn.innerHTML = '<i data-lucide="play" class="w-5 h-5 fill-white"></i>';
                status.innerText = "Jeda";
                status.className = "text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300";
            }
            lucide.createIcons();
        }

        // Flashcard Flip
        let flashcardFlipped = false;
        function flipFlashcard() {
            flashcardFlipped = !flashcardFlipped;
            const text = document.getElementById('flashcard-text');
            if(flashcardFlipped) {
                text.innerText = "Jawaban: Menggunakan pendekatan personalized learning agar siswa benar-benar paham materi sesuai gayanya, sehingga rasa panik dan niat curang hilang secara alami.";
            } else {
                text.innerText = "Apa solusi utama mencegah siswa mencontek tanpa harus menghukum?";
            }
        }

        // Timer Logic
        let timerInterval;
        let totalSeconds = 30 * 60;
        function startTimer() {
            clearInterval(timerInterval);
            timerInterval = setInterval(() => {
                if(totalSeconds > 0) {
                    totalSeconds--;
                    let m = Math.floor(totalSeconds / 60);
                    let s = totalSeconds % 60;
                    document.getElementById('timer-display').innerText = `${m < 10 ? '0':''}${m}:${s < 10 ? '0':''}${s}`;
                }
            }, 1000);
        }
        function resetTimer() {
            clearInterval(timerInterval);
            totalSeconds = 30 * 60;
            document.getElementById('timer-display').innerText = "30:00";
        }

        // Chart Render
        function renderChart() {
            const ctx = document.getElementById('integrityChart').getContext('2d');
            window.myChartInstance = new Chart(ctx, {
                type: 'line',
                data: {
                    labels: ['Minggu 1', 'Minggu 2', 'Minggu 3', 'Minggu 4'],
                    datasets: [{
                        label: 'Skor Pemahaman Materi (%)',
                        data: [60, 75, 88, 95],
                        borderColor: '#16a34a',
                        backgroundColor: 'rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.1)',
                        fill: true,
                        tension: 0.3
                    }]
                },
                options: {
                    responsive: true,
                    maintainAspectRatio: false,
                    plugins: { legend: { labels: { font: { family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', size: 11 } } } }
                }
            });
        }

        // Pakta Integritas
        function signPakta() {
            const badge = document.getElementById('badge-status');
            badge.innerText = "Terverifikasi: Duta Kejujuran & Integritas 2045 ⭐";
            badge.className = "text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-emerald-300 inline-block";
            alert("Terima kasih! Komitmen integritasmu telah tercatat sebagai fondasi generasi anti-korupsi.");
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
